<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-Z SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-Z SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.82 vs   0.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.10 vs   0.33</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.08 vs   1.66</p>
<p> Sales		   15.29 vs  11.63</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.80 vs   6.08</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.41 vs   7.02</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.63 vs   7.08</p>
<p> Sales		  150.10 vs  98.58</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Zabrze SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
